# One line ending on every checkout. Git for Windows ships core.autocrlf=true
# in its system config, which checked the tree out as CRLF: prettier (endOfLine
# lf) flagged all 103 files, and any .md the extension reads at runtime
# (scout-system-prompt.md) would have carried CR into what a model is told.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ans -text
